<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54516" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταμετρ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>measure out</i>, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῖτον</span>] 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖσι ἐπικούροισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.91
				</span></i>
			; of a garden, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				4.21
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεγέθη, πέρατα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				1p.17U.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sent.</u>
				19
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑμῖν αὐτοῖς τὰ ὅρια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Nu.</u>
					34.10
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῷ -μετρεῖσθαι ὑμᾶς τὴν
				γῆν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Ez.</u>
				45.1
			</span></i>; of castrametation, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				6.41.4
			</span></i>; <i>assign</i> land held by military tenure, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν -μεμετρημένων</span> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλήρων</span>] <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				2
			</span></i> intr.<i><span class="en">
				p.22
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				245.2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, al.; also of the grantees, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς -μεαετρημένους ἱππεῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PHal.</u>
					15.5
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLille</u>
				14.3
			</span></i><span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>measure exactly, be the measure of</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόριον ὃ -μετρήσει τὴν ὅλην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					237b28
				</span></i>
			 (for wh. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναμ-</span> is used <i><span class="en">
				238a22
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ -μετροῦντά τινων</span>
			<i>aliquot parts</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1023b15
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ λόγος -μετρεῖται συλλαβῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Cat.</u>
					4b33
				</span></i>
			: esp. in Metric, of feet or rhythms, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				17
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Dem.</u>
				39
			</span></i>.</div>
